{"seq":1,"slug":"delivery-event-and-lateness-basis","title":"妥投事件与超时判定口径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/guaranteed-delivery-sla-promise/lateness-determination/delivery-event-and-lateness-basis","wordCount":2980,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"妥投事件与超时判定口径\">妥投事件与超时判定口径</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>超时判定表面上是一次减法：承诺时刻减妥投时刻，正数即超时。真正决定它的不是算术，而是两侧的<strong>口径</strong>——哪一个承运商扫描事件算「妥投」，哪一个时间戳算「承诺截止」。把妥投定义从「派送尝试」换成「签收扫描」，或把承诺截止从「目的地日末 23:59:59」换成「承运商承诺时刻 10:30」，同一订单可能从准时翻转为超时两天。跨境场景把它放大：妥投扫描发生在买家所在国的当地时间，承诺却在下单时用目的国服务日历算出，两侧若不在同一时区、同一日历上比较，误差就是小时级甚至一天级。</p>\n<p>因此本文把超时判定拆成三个必须显式选择的决策，缺一个都会让判定不可复现：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>决策</th>\n<th>可选口径</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>妥投事件定义</td>\n<td>派送尝试 / 妥投扫描 / 签收（POD） / 自提柜取出 / 末端入站扫描</td>\n<td>决定「早到」还是「晚到」，差异可达数日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承诺截止时刻</td>\n<td>承诺日当地日末 23:59:59 / 承运商承诺时刻 / 分钟级时间戳</td>\n<td>决定容忍窗口是 0 秒还是 24 小时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间基准</td>\n<td>承运商上报的当地时区 / UTC / 平台统一时区</td>\n<td>决定跨境是否系统性偏移</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;下单 / 出库&lt;br/&gt;生成承诺截止 t_deadline&quot;] --&gt; C{&quot;超时判定引擎&quot;}&#10;    B[&quot;承运商轨迹事件&lt;br/&gt;原始本地时间 + 地点&quot;] --&gt; B1[&quot;时区归一&lt;br/&gt;转 UTC + 记目的地本地时间&quot;]&#10;    B1 --&gt; B2{&quot;妥投事件定义&quot;}&#10;    B2 --&gt;|投递扫描| D[&quot;t_delivered&quot;]&#10;    B2 --&gt;|仅派送尝试| D2[&quot;t_attempt&lt;br/&gt;标记为待确认&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; C&#10;    D2 --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; E{&quot;t_delivered &gt; t_deadline + 宽限?&quot;}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[&quot;超时&lt;br/&gt;进入赔付与承运商索赔&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[&quot;准时&lt;br/&gt;计入 OTDR / DIFOT&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|证据不足| H[&quot;待定&lt;br/&gt;挂起等待 POD / 人工复核&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"下单 / 出库&lt;br/&gt;生成承诺截止 t_deadline\"] --&gt; C{\"超时判定引擎\"}\n    B[\"承运商轨迹事件&lt;br/&gt;原始本地时间 + 地点\"] --&gt; B1[\"时区归一&lt;br/&gt;转 UTC + 记目的地本地时间\"]\n    B1 --&gt; B2{\"妥投事件定义\"}\n    B2 --&gt;|投递扫描| D[\"t_delivered\"]\n    B2 --&gt;|仅派送尝试| D2[\"t_attempt&lt;br/&gt;标记为待确认\"]\n    D --&gt; C\n    D2 --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; E{\"t_delivered &gt; t_deadline + 宽限?\"}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[\"超时&lt;br/&gt;进入赔付与承运商索赔\"]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[\"准时&lt;br/&gt;计入 OTDR / DIFOT\"]\n    E --&gt;|证据不足| H[\"待定&lt;br/&gt;挂起等待 POD / 人工复核\"]</pre><p>最容易被忽略的是 <code>H</code> 这条支路。「证据不足」不是异常而是常态：跨境件常有只报「派送中」就再无扫描的包裹，也有先报 <code>Delivered</code> 又被逆向单覆盖的记录。判定引擎必须能表达「我不知道」，把未知默认成准时或超时都会污染下游指标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"承诺时刻的来源与粒度\">承诺时刻的来源与粒度</h2><p>承诺截止 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>deadline</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{deadline}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">deadline</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通常来自下单时的承诺计算服务，而非承运商回传，其构成为「处理时间 + 运输时间 + 日历规则」：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>deadline</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>EOD</mtext><mtext>dest</mtext></msub><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>order</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>handling</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>transit</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{deadline}} = \\text{EOD}_{\\text{dest}}\\!\\left(d_{\\text{order}} + H_{\\text{handling}} + T_{\\text{transit}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">deadline</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EOD</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dest</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">order</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">handling</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">transit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>handling</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{\\text{handling}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">handling</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是卖家处理时长（订单截止后的第一个工作日到出库），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>transit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{transit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">transit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是按承运商与目的邮编查得的运输时长，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>EOD</mtext><mtext>dest</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{EOD}_{\\text{dest}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EOD</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dest</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 把结果收敛到目的地时区的日末。<strong>关键陷阱在于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>EOD</mtext><mtext>dest</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{EOD}_{\\text{dest}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EOD</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dest</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong>：它依赖目的国时区库与节假日日历，未更新的公共假日日历会让整批订单承诺日偏一天。承诺粒度并不统一，这直接决定判定引擎要不要支持「日」以外的单位：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台 / 场景</th>\n<th>承诺粒度</th>\n<th>超时基准</th>\n<th>可核验来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Amazon 卖家自配送（FBM）</td>\n<td>日期（Estimated Delivery Date）</td>\n<td>送达日不晚于 EDT</td>\n<td>Seller Central OTDR 门槛 90%，配套 Valid Tracking Rate ≥ 95%，sellercentral.amazon.com</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>eBay Guaranteed Delivery</td>\n<td>日期</td>\n<td>承诺日当天日末</td>\n<td>eBay 官方 Guaranteed Delivery 说明，ebay.com</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shopify Shop Promise</td>\n<td>日期（机器学习预估）</td>\n<td>展示的预计送达日</td>\n<td>Shopify Shop Promise 文档，shopify.com</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UPS / FedEx / DHL 时效件</td>\n<td>具体时刻（如 10:30、12:00）</td>\n<td>承运商 commit time</td>\n<td>各承运商当期运价表与 Service Guarantee 条款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B2B 补货（Walmart 供应商）</td>\n<td>窗口（如 3 天交付窗）</td>\n<td>窗口内任意时点</td>\n<td>Walmart 供应商 OTIF 目标 98%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>只做「日期」的平台可把截止时刻固化为目的地当地 23:59:59；做时效件的平台必须存分钟级时间戳，并处理承运商 commit time 与平台承诺不一致的情况——买家看到的日期来自平台，承运商考核的是自己的承诺时刻。</p>\n<h2 id=\"妥投事件的证据层级\">妥投事件的证据层级</h2><p>「妥投」在承运商数据里不是单一事件，而是有强弱之分的证据链。EDI X12 214（Transportation Carrier Shipment Status Message）用状态码表达这些阶段，其中 <code>X1</code> 为 Delivered、<code>D1</code> 为到达交付地、<code>X6</code> 为在途派送（X12.org 标准定义）。映射成内部证据等级是判定引擎的核心资产：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>证据等级</th>\n<th>事件</th>\n<th>可信度</th>\n<th>典型问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1</td>\n<td>签收影像 + 签名（ePOD）</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>跨境件常不提供或仅有纸质 POD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2</td>\n<td>承运商投递扫描（Delivered / <code>X1</code>）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>「先扫后送」与「代收点扫描」两种歧义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3</td>\n<td>首次派送尝试（Attempted）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>只能证明「到过」，不能证明「已交付」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4</td>\n<td>末端派送商入站扫描</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>与妥投相差 0–3 天，不可直接当妥投</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L5</td>\n<td>买家自述「已收到」</td>\n<td>视场景</td>\n<td>无承运商佐证时不能单独作为赔付依据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选择哪一级作为判定基准，本质是<strong>在误判成本之间取舍</strong>：以 L2 为基准会漏掉「买家投诉未收到、但承运商报了 Delivered」的争议，以 L1 为基准则大量跨境件永远「待定」。实务做法是分层：<strong>主判定用 L2，争议裁决用 L1 加权，赔付门槛可单独抬高</strong>；Amazon 的 OTDR 即以送达确认（L2）计算准时率。</p>\n<p>一个会制造假阳性的细节：<strong>妥投扫描可被后续事件撤销</strong>。包裹投递后又因地址错误被逆向揽收，或在代收点超期未取被退回，都会让同一条运单出现「Delivered 后又 Picked Up」的序列。判定引擎必须支持事件回滚——把已计入准时率的订单重标为「未妥投」，并对已发出的赔付做冲正。这要求判定结果是<strong>可重算的派生值</strong>，而非写死的事实。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时区-截止边界与迟到时长计算\">时区、截止边界与迟到时长计算</h2><p>跨境判定的技术核心是时区归一。承运商上报的扫描时间通常带本地时间但<strong>不带可靠的时区偏移</strong>，而扫描设施可能位于不同时区。稳妥做法是：按扫描地点（国家 + 城市）查 IANA 时区库得到偏移，缺失时回退到目的国主时区，并在事件上同时保留 UTC 与目的地本地时间两个字段。</p>\n<p>迟到时长用如下公式计算，宽限项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>grace</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{\\text{grace}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">grace</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 抵消上报延迟与扫描粒度误差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mtext>delivered</mtext><mtext>UTC</mtext></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>tz</mtext><mtext>dest</mtext></msubsup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mtext>deadline</mtext><mtext>dest</mtext></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>grace</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\max\\!\\left(0,\\; \\left(t_{\\text{delivered}}^{\\text{UTC}} + \\Delta_{\\text{tz}}^{\\text{dest}}\\right) - t_{\\text{deadline}}^{\\text{dest}} - B_{\\text{grace}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2491em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">delivered</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">UTC</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tz</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dest</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">deadline</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dest</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">grace</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>tz</mtext><mtext>dest</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{\\text{tz}}^{\\text{dest}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0961em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tz</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dest</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是目的地时区相对 UTC 的偏移，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mtext>deadline</mtext><mtext>dest</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{deadline}}^{\\text{dest}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1322em;vertical-align:-0.2831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4169em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">deadline</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dest</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 已是目的地本地时间的截止点。<strong>把公式每一项都落库</strong>而非只落 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，是判定可审计的前提——否则事后无法回答「这单为什么被判超时」。</p>\n<p>边界情况需要单独写测试用例：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>日界线</strong>：若扫描时间按 UTC 上报，23:59:59 本地与 UTC 可能相差整整一天，跨 UTC+12 至 UTC-12 的目的地会出现同一扫描时刻既判准时又判超时的情形。</li>\n<li><strong>夏令时切换</strong>：切换当天同一本地钟表时间对应两个 UTC 时刻，偏移按固定值硬编码就会错一小时。</li>\n<li><strong>日期粒度承诺</strong>：须显式定义「当天到」是否算准时——通行做法是当天 23:59:59 前妥投即算准时。</li>\n<li><strong>承运商承诺时刻</strong>：时效件 commit time（如 10:30）不是日末，超时窗口从 0 秒到承运商自定容差不等。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"免责与例外情形\">免责与例外情形</h2><p>并非所有超时都应归责于卖家。判定引擎需要一个**免责裁定（exception adjudication）**层，否则承运商侧原因会以真实赔付吃掉卖家毛利：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>例外类别</th>\n<th>典型事件</th>\n<th>是否可免责</th>\n<th>判断依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>清关卡滞</td>\n<td>海关查验、缺单证、缴税未响应</td>\n<td>通常可免责</td>\n<td>目的国清关放行后重新起算运输时长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不可抗力</td>\n<td>极端天气、罢工、港口拥堵</td>\n<td>依承运商与平台条款</td>\n<td>承运商公布的正式服务中断公告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>买家原因</td>\n<td>地址不可达、无人签收、拒收、未取件</td>\n<td>可免责</td>\n<td>派送尝试记录 + 通知留痕</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卖家原因</td>\n<td>迟发、错发地址、包装不合规</td>\n<td>不可免责</td>\n<td>出库晚于订单截止即成立</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承运商原因</td>\n<td>分拣错发、丢件、扫描缺失</td>\n<td>可免责且可索赔</td>\n<td>与承运商索赔流程衔接</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>法规给了这条线一个下限。欧盟《消费者权利指令》Directive 2011/83/EU 第 18 条要求：除非另有约定，经营者应在合同订立后 <strong>30 天内</strong>交付商品；逾期未交付时，消费者可再指定一个合理期限，仍未交付即可解除合同，经营者须在 14 天内退款（eur-lex.europa.eu），该指令经 Directive (EU) 2019/2161 修订后强化了交付时限的信息披露要求。美国方面，FTC 规则 16 CFR Part 435 要求未明示发货时限时须在 <strong>30 天内</strong>发货，无法按期则须通知消费者并提供退款或延期（ftc.gov）。含义是：<strong>「承诺」不只是营销数字，而是可执行的交付义务</strong>；Visa「Merchandise/Services Not Received」（争议条件 13.1）与 Mastercard「Goods or Services Not Received」都以「是否在承诺期内送达」为核心事实，判定输出必须能作为争议应答证据包。</p>\n<h2 id=\"判定管道的工程实现\">判定管道的工程实现</h2><p>落成管道时，三个工程约束决定它能否长期可信。</p>\n<p><strong>第一，事件不可变，判定可重算。</strong> 原始轨迹事件（含来源、原始时间、时区、原文）一次写入后不修改，修正以新增事件表达；判定结果是纯函数 <code>f(事件集, 承诺, 口径配置)</code> 的输出。当妥投口径从 L3 改为 L2，或发现某国时区映射错误时，可全量重算而不必回溯修数据。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，判定必须幂等。</strong> 同一批事件重复消费不能产生两次赔付。把判定的输入指纹（事件集版本 + 承诺版本 + 口径版本）作为幂等键，输出带版本号；下游赔付只认状态翻转。</p>\n<p><strong>第三，判定要能与承运商索赔对账。</strong> 买家侧用平台承诺，承运商侧用其 commit time 与 Service Guarantee 条款（UPS、FedEx、DHL 的时效件退运费条款普遍以承诺时刻为准，疫情期曾收窄适用范围，以当期运价表为准），两套结论分别存储、可交叉查询。</p>\n<p>指标侧口径要与判定同源，否则会出现「系统算超时率 6%，平台后台却显示 4%」的对账失败。跨境履约常用 <strong>DIFOT</strong> 与承运商的 <strong>OTIF</strong> 度量：DIFOT 同时考核「足量」与「准时」，其准时分量必须与本文妥投口径一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>超时判定是三个显式决策的乘积：<strong>妥投事件定义、承诺截止时刻、时间基准</strong>；任意一个不显式，判定都不可复现。</li>\n<li>承诺粒度决定数据模型：日粒度可固化为目的地当地 23:59:59，时效件必须存分钟级时间戳并单独记账承运商 commit time。</li>\n<li>妥投证据分五级，主判定取投递扫描（L2），争议裁决用签收影像（L1）加权；只报派送尝试的订单应进入「待定」。</li>\n<li>时区归一是跨境核心技术风险：按设施时区还原扫描时间，同时保留 UTC 与目的地本地时间，并对日界线、夏令时、日粒度边界写专门用例。</li>\n<li>免责裁定必须显式建模（清关卡滞、不可抗力、买家原因、卖家原因、承运商原因）。</li>\n<li>欧盟指令 2011/83/EU 第 18 条与美国 16 CFR Part 435 的 30 天规则使承诺成为可执行的交付义务；工程上坚持事件不可变、判定可重算、输出幂等，三套口径分开存储、交叉对账。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本文与相邻主题的分工：承诺数字如何生成见<a href=\"../\">本章索引</a>；判定成立之后如何自动触发赔付与承运商索赔，见同 hub 第三章。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"妥投事件与超时判定口径","id":"妥投事件与超时判定口径"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"承诺时刻的来源与粒度","id":"承诺时刻的来源与粒度"},{"level":2,"text":"妥投事件的证据层级","id":"妥投事件的证据层级"},{"level":2,"text":"时区、截止边界与迟到时长计算","id":"时区-截止边界与迟到时长计算"},{"level":2,"text":"免责与例外情形","id":"免责与例外情形"},{"level":2,"text":"判定管道的工程实现","id":"判定管道的工程实现"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"保证送达商品准入与排除规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/guaranteed-delivery-sla-promise/delivery-promise-product/guaranteed-item-eligibility-exclusion"},"next":{"title":"承诺时钟与例外事件顺延机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/guaranteed-delivery-sla-promise/lateness-determination/promise-clock-exception-events"}}